<!-- android-agent-playbook:start -->
Follow the repository rules in `AGENTS.md` at the project root: commands, architecture, module rules, the Never touch list and the Done checklist.

Before finishing any change, run:

- `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug`
- `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`
- `./gradlew :app:lintDebug && ./gradlew ktlintCheck`

Playbooks for common tasks live in `.agents/skills/`. The matching commands are `/add-screen`, `/add-feature-module`, `/migrate-to-compose`, `/write-tests`, `/fix-build`.
<!-- android-agent-playbook:end -->
